# Data Dictionary

## Dataset Overview

This project analyzes social media discussions related to US TikTok regulatory events from 2020 to 2024.

---

## Key Fields

| Field | Description |
|---|---|
| user_name | Unique identifier of Twitter users |
| created_date | Date when the tweet was created |
| engagement | Total interaction generated by the tweet |
| followers | Number of followers of the user |
| source | Source or collection period of the discussion |
| regulatory_event | Indicator of major regulatory milestones |

---

## Derived Metrics

The analysis created additional metrics including:

- Total Tweets
- Unique Users
- Total Engagement
- Average Engagement per Tweet
- Average Engagement per User
- Actor Engagement Ranking
